```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Git as Git Repo
    participant WH as Webhook
    participant API as argocd-server
    participant CR as Application CR
    participant AC as application-controller
    participant RS as argocd-repo-server
    participant Redis as argocd-redis
    participant K8S as K8s API (Live Cluster)

    Git->>WH: 1. Git commit (push event)
    WH->>API: 2. POST /api/webhook
    API->>CR: 3. Set refresh annotation
    Note over CR: argocd.argoproj.io/refresh=normal

    AC->>CR: 4. Watch detects annotation change
    AC->>RS: 5. Request rendered manifests
    RS->>Redis: 6a. Check cache
    alt Cache miss
        RS->>Git: 6b. Clone repo
        RS->>RS: 6c. helm template / kustomize build
        RS->>Redis: 6d. Store in cache
    end
    RS->>AC: 7. Return rendered YAML (desired state)

    AC->>K8S: 8. Read live state
    AC->>AC: 9. Compare desired vs live state
    alt Out-of-Sync
        AC->>K8S: 10. Apply diff (kubectl apply)
    end
```